id=force_disable_hw_overlays
name=Force Disable HW Overlays
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=requiredroot
description=Forces the "Disable HW overlays" developer option to stay ON. Re-applies disable_hw_overlays=1 at every boot and re-enables it if anything turns it off. Disables the display hardware composer's overlay planes, so SurfaceFlinger composes every layer on the GPU (client composition). Debugging option, not a performance one.
